    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>	
	<isBad>false</isBad>
	<tendable>false</tendable>
	<label>brood queen's womb</label>
    <labelNoun>a brood queen's womb</labelNoun>
    <description>Were it not for the hypertrophied tentacle "wings" emerging from this Nephilim Grand Matron's back, she would have been crushed under the planetary girth of her womb long ago. As it is, her gooey tentacles work full time to soothe the quaking organ, keeping it moist and pampered even as it remains inches from cataclysmic rupture. The Grand Matron either doesn't care how dangerous her growth or become, or finds it a turn-on. She has achieved her aim of becoming nothing more than a "baby" factory, and the world will tremble under the weight of her many young.</description>	
